WEBVTT

00:02:29.896 --> 00:02:30.897
be real,

00:02:30.897 --> 00:02:32.732
I felt free somehow.

00:02:32.815 --> 00:02:35.443
It wasn’t always pretty 
but at least it felt safe,

00:02:35.443 --> 00:02:38.446
like this is a place
where we can be ourselves.

00:02:41.616 --> 00:02:43.451
But in 2020,

00:02:43.451 --> 00:02:47.246
when the pandemic hit the planet,

00:02:47.246 --> 00:02:49.290
we all started questioning
what home meant.

00:02:49.707 --> 00:02:51.292
My parents were architects --

00:02:51.292 --> 00:02:52.627
are architects,

00:02:52.627 --> 00:02:57.590
so they also added to what I felt home
was to my definition of home.

00:02:58.090 --> 00:03:01.427
Because before following
my own dreams --